Autonomous Sovereign Inquisitor & Pull Request Alignment Gatekeeper

Usage: spark-inquisitor <COMMAND>

Commands:
  review        Review a PR diff and generate unified code review markdown comment
  triage-issue  Triage an issue (bug report, complaint, feature request, inquiry)
  interview     Generate the Sovereign Alignment Interview comment for a Pull Request
  audit         Audit a git diff for telemetry, surveillance, and unslop violations
  fix           Automatically sanitize unslop formatting (em dashes, en dashes) in specified file
  evaluate      Evaluate contributor testimony against the project standards
  doctor        Run internal self-diagnostics
  help          Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
